                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.91293/171: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-08-09T20:00:00-04:00">August 9, 1929—8
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>264. Your 692, August 8, 11 p.m. Your last sentence. Department’s telegram July
                    23, 4 p.m. is cancelled. You may recommend further steps when you consider them
                    necessary.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cotton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
